{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_a5905276d3a216799da43f19296d6b8f8c36ef356891028f82fe4f629563f68b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The frontend is a ReactFlow-based flow editor supporting node dragging, edge wiring, and parameter editing, with a node panel, canvas, and configuration panel."}],"claim_ids":["clm_a5905276d3a216799da43f19296d6b8f8c36ef356891028f82fe4f629563f68b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:59:38Z","created_by_operation":"op_16c82736790c423bafbe66e14a1936ff","id":"pg_7d7026762df65ea2bd39bea8e8c77f64","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/itwanger-paiagent-docs-final-summary-md-05297308189f-bea8e8c77f64.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_507d67588ee55cfb81a7213a139be180"],"title":"itwanger/PaiAgent/docs/FINAL_SUMMARY.md @ 05297308189f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:59:38Z","updated_by_operation":"op_16c82736790c423bafbe66e14a1936ff"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_5855780a08a556bc688828aede3928d6f15a08f883136c5a65ae70a930b743c7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the integration plan's test plan calls for backend unit tests (./mvnw test), frontend npm run build verification, and mock-based integration acceptance of a web content production workflow."},{"claim_ids":["clm_696ec7009591b47894ea23641fa212728108c394d8591a951cd5577bb9b4d94f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A plan document proposes memory nodes (memory_write/memory_retrieve) backed by local agent_memory tables and Doubao-embedding-vision embeddings, with workflow/user/global scopes and explicit (not automatic) memory writes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b0a523d224d1f0301fe4f80e762249ae4fd312b0ead739e6a0823bc6c4748a1e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"MinIO is listed as an optional object storage dependency; the Agent Plan plan proposes transferring generated images and videos to MinIO to avoid reliance on vendor temporary URLs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d2632504b040d72f23f04e041f855f5477bf8eed918ad7e89a6e6547a53325dd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plan adds a volcengine_agent_plan provider with global config fields for embedding, image, video, and TTS models plus webSearchEnabled and memoryEnabled toggles, normalizing provider aliases like 'ark' and '火山方舟'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ece923b61180a4ba6cddd106e87561664de24b4fde9a97fa055feb261cae51cf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Agent Plan integration plan specifies new node types: web_search/web_fetch, memory_write/memory_retrieve, image_generate/video_generate/vision_analyze, and knowledge_upsert/knowledge_retrieve, also registrable as ReAct Agent tools."}],"claim_ids":["clm_5855780a08a556bc688828aede3928d6f15a08f883136c5a65ae70a930b743c7","clm_696ec7009591b47894ea23641fa212728108c394d8591a951cd5577bb9b4d94f","clm_b0a523d224d1f0301fe4f80e762249ae4fd312b0ead739e6a0823bc6c4748a1e","clm_d2632504b040d72f23f04e041f855f5477bf8eed918ad7e89a6e6547a53325dd","clm_ece923b61180a4ba6cddd106e87561664de24b4fde9a97fa055feb261cae51cf"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:59:38Z","created_by_operation":"op_16c82736790c423bafbe66e14a1936ff","id":"pg_8a5d7b58117c5781b67253e9cf5853ac","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/itwanger-paiagent-docs-agent-plan-harness-integration-plan-md-05297308-53e9cf5853ac.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_19ebf01509515fb5a05b0f4c1882fdde"],"title":"itwanger/PaiAgent/docs/agent-plan-harness-integration-plan.md @ 05297308189f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:59:38Z","updated_by_operation":"op_16c82736790c423bafbe66e14a1936ff"}
